oke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-3 h-3 text-slate-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative text-center group\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap\"><span>Media</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-3 h-3 text-slate-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative text-center group\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/journal\">Journal</a></div><div class=\"relative text-center group\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/conference\">Conference</a></div><div class=\"relative text-center group\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></nav></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800\"><section class=\"relative py-12 md:py-20 px-4 sm:px-4 lg:px-4 pt-6 md:pt-6 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"relative w-full mx-auto rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-slate-900/50 min-h-125 flex items-center\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"Governance Hero\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover object-center scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Governance Hero Mobile\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover object-center scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-bg-mobile.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-slate-950/90 via-slate-950/60 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-slate-950/70 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 py-12 md:py-20\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wide\">Governance</span></nav><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-700/50 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-500 rounded-full\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-amber-400\">GOVERNANCE</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white tracking-wide max-w-3xl mb-6 leading-tight\">Institutional Leadership &amp; Governance</h1><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed\">A unified framework of trustees, advisory bodies, scientific councils and academic leadership guiding the Institute&#x27;s global mission.</p><a class=\"group bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/40 transition duration-200\" href=\"#senior-leadership\"><span>Leadership Directory</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-emerald-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-slate-100 border-b border-slate-200/80 py-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300/80\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">06</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">GOVERNING BODIES</p></div><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300/80\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">25</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">OFFICE HOLDERS</p></div><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300/80\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">08</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">ACADEMIC DEPARTMENTS</p></div><div class=\"text-center \"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">12+</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">PARTNER INSTITUTIONS</p></div></div></section><section class=\"pt-20 pb-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">GOVERNANCE</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-4 max-w-2xl\">Academic Integrity Through Governance</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Each body carries a defined mandate — from strategic stewardship to scientific evaluation — ensuring transparent decision-making across the Institute.</p></section><section id=\"senior-leadership\" class=\"py-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-slate-200\"><div class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-4\">Senior Institute Leadership</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\"><p>The Board of Trustees is the supreme governing authority of the International Research Institute for Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an (IRITAQ). It is entrusted with safeguarding the Institute&#x27;s vision, mission, and long-term strategic direction while ensuring that its academic and institutional objectives are achieved with excellence and integrity.</p><p>The Board provides leadership in policy formulation, institutional development, financial sustainability, and international expansion. It also oversees governance, approves major strategic initiatives, and strengthens relationships with universities, research institutions, and global academic organizations.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col w-full bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-700/30\"><div class=\"px-2.5 py-2 text-center border-b transition-colors bg-[#1b4d3e] text-white border-emerald-900/15\"><span class=\"block font-semibold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-wide whitespace-normal break-words text-[9px] xs:text-[9.5px] sm:text-[10px] md:text-[10.5px]\">GRAND PATRON</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#d8ebf9]\"><img alt=\"Prof. Sayyid Muhammed Jifri Muthukoya Thangal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[center_15%] scale-105 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 20vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fthangalusthad.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fthangalusthad.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fthangalusthad.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fthangalusthad.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fthangalusthad.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/i