g.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmusqzmtng.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"px-3 py-3.5 sm:py-4 text-center flex-1 flex items-center justify-center bg-white\"><h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-[15px] font-serif font-medium leading-snug transition-colors text-slate-800 group-hover:text-emerald-800\">Prof. Dr. Sayyid Musa Al-Kadzimi</h3></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-xl border border-emerald-900/60\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-white mb-4\">International Advisory Board</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8\"><p>The International Advisory Board comprises distinguished scholars, academics, researchers, and professionals from different parts of the world who contribute their expertise to the strategic and academic development of the Institute.</p><p>The Board provides independent advice on institutional growth, international collaboration, research priorities, academic quality, and emerging opportunities in Qur&#x27;anic studies.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col w-full bg-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-800/60 shadow-lg hover:border-emerald-500/60 hover:shadow-emerald-950/50\"><div class=\"px-2.5 py-2 text-center border-b transition-colors bg-amber-900/95 text-amber-50 border-amber-500/30\"><span class=\"block font-semibold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-wide whitespace-normal break-words text-[7px] xs:text-[7.5px] sm:text-[8px] md:text-[8.5px]\">CHAIRMAN, INTERNATIONAL ADVISORY BOARD</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-emerald-950\"><img alt=\"Dr. Ibrahim Sayyid Salah Hud Hud\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[center_15%] scale-105 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform dur