 faculty and researchers, promoting interdisciplinary collaboration, establishing international academic partnerships, and ensuring the highest standards of excellence in Qur&#x27;anic scholarship.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col w-full bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-700/30\"><div class=\"px-2.5 py-2 text-center border-b transition-colors bg-[#1b4d3e] text-white border-emerald-900/15\"><span class=\"block font-semibold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-wide whitespace-normal break-words text-[9px] xs:text-[9.5px] sm:text-[10px] md:text-[10.5px]\">ASSOCIATE DEAN</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#d8ebf9]\"><img alt=\"Sayyid Mubashir Jamalullaili al-Darimi\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[center_15%] scale-105 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 20vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmbsrtng.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?