0 flex flex-col w-full bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-700/30\"><div class=\"px-2.5 py-2 text-center border-b transition-colors bg-[#1b4d3e] text-white border-emerald-900/15\"><span class=\"block font-semibold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-wide whitespace-normal break-words text-[9px] xs:text-[9.5px] sm:text-[10px] md:text-[10.5px]\">RESEARCH ASSOCIATE</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#d8ebf9]\"><img alt=\"Luckman Jalali Muthuvallur\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[center_15%] scale-105 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 20vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flqmnjll.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"px-3 py-3.5 sm:py-4 text-center flex-1 flex items-center justify-center bg-white\"><h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-[15px] font-serif font-medium leading-snug transition-colors text-slate-800 group-hover:text-emerald-800\">Luckman Jalali Muthuvallur</h3></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">FRAMEWORK</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-6\">Organizational Structure</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\"><p>IRITAQ operates through a comprehensive institutional framework designed to promote academic excellence, effective governance, and sustainable development. The organizational structure integrates the Board of Trustees, International Advisory Board, International Scientific Council, Executive Leadership, Academic Leadership, and specialized research departments into a unified system of administration and scholarship.</p><p>This structure ensures clear responsibilities, transparent decision-making, efficient institutional management, and strong collaboration among scholars, researchers, administrators, and international partners. It enables the Institute to achieve its vision of becoming a globally recognized centre of excellence in Qur&#x27;anic research and academic innovation.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 w-full mx-auto px-3 pt-3\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-14 shadow-xl border border-emerald-900/60 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif text-white mb-3\">Collaborate with the Institute</h2><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed\">Universities, research centres and scholarly organisations are invited to engage with IRITAQ through joint research, publications and academic partnerships.</p></div><a class=\"bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 transition shadow-lg hove